i)    APPROVE the Contribution Agreement between The Corporation of the City of London and Perpetually Innovative Developments Inc. and 2614442 Ontario Inc., attached as Schedule “1”;

ii)    APPROVE the Contribution Agreement between The Corporation of the City of London and Zerin Development Corporation, attached as Schedule “2”;

iii)    AUTHORIZE the Mayor and the City Clerk to execute the Contribution Agreements;

iv)    AUTHORIZE the Deputy City Manager, Housing and Community Growth, or their written designate, to approve amendments to the Contribution Agreements; 

v)    AUTHORIZE the Deputy City Manager, Housing and Community Growth, or their written designate, to approve and execute further amending agreements to the Contribution Agreements.

c)    the Civic Administration BE DIRECTED to provide the following details based on the 2024 data used in Appendix B of the staff report, dated February 17, 2026, entitled “Affordable and Community Housing Update”, to the Community and Protective Services Committee:

 

i)         a list of the 43% of Housing Providers who “do not generate and retain enough cash to pay for short-term debts” and the number of units in each (RGI, etc.);

ii)         a list of the 25% of Housing Providers whose “future survival” is at “significant risk”; and,

iii)         a brief summary of each of the above with the estimated timeline for insolvency, the funding source and amount available for these issues and the manner in which any Service Manager intervention will be reported to Council;

-    a communication from Councillor C. Rahman, dated March 5, 2026;

-    a communication from Councillor S. Stevenson, dated March 5, 2026;

-    a Memo from the Deputy City Manager, Housing and Community Growth and the Director, Municipal Housing and Industrial Development, dated March 6, 2026; and,

-    a communication and a verbal delegation from J. Phoenix.

